# Generated data snapshot -- fetched fresh by scripts/fetch-data.mjs
# (locally) or by the GitHub Actions workflow (on every scheduled run and
# deploy). Not committed, so it never goes stale in git history and a
# locally-fetched copy (which used your own machine's clock/API call)
# never gets mixed up with what's actually deployed.
data/data.json

